[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_PROSPERITY]
Promise of Prosperity

[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_PROSPERITY_desc]
Under the roaring machinery, there is a scene of prosperity - the fundamental support for the continuous output of votes.

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_PROSPERITY]
繁荣的承诺

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_PROSPERITY_desc]
在那轰轰运转的机械下，是一片繁荣的景象——也是支持票源源不断产出的根本。

